## 🧬 Construction Framework (5Ws + So What + Temporal Context)

| Dimension  | Pull From | Purpose |
|------------|-----------|---------|
| **WHAT**   | `semantic_action_statement.section_1_customer_reality` + `matters` (+ short clause from `context` if useful) | State the core customer reality, grounded in emotion and behavior |
| **WHEN**   | `interaction_moment` | Pinpoint when the issue occurs |
| **WHERE**  | `experience_driver` + `customer_journey` + `customer_journey_stage` | Operationally locate the issue |
| **WHY**    | `stream_justification` | Explain why this stream is the correct strategic/structural path |
| **SO WHAT**| `behavioral_impact` | Define the business risk or consequence if unresolved |
| **⭐ TEMPORAL CONTEXT** | `temporal_signals` (all 5 dimensions) | Assess urgency, trajectory, and strategic timing |

